    <string name="omnibox_title">Website blocking needs a re-check</string>
    <!--
      REVISED 2026-08-05, to stop contradicting the Lock row that now shows the same state. It said
      only "blocked sites may not be getting blocked any more", which describes the seven days that
      have just ENDED by the time this fires: at STALE the vouch is withdrawn, so an unreadable bar
      becomes a block. Keep this in step with protection_omnibox_stale_body.
    -->
    <string name="omnibox_text">Your browser updated a week ago and App-Block hasn\'t managed to read its address bar since. Blocked sites may have been slipping through, and from now on pages it can\'t read get blocked instead. Open the browser on any page with the address bar showing — that re-checks it, and this will go away.</string>
